setAllowlistEnabled
├── when the caller does not have ALLOWLIST_OPERATOR_ROLE
│   └── it should revert
└── when the caller has ALLOWLIST_OPERATOR_ROLE
    ├── it should enable enforcement
    ├── it should disable enforcement
    ├── it should preserve membership through disabling and re-enabling
    ├── it should emit AllowlistEnabledSet
    ├── it should emit when already enabled
    └── it should emit when already disabled
